  "title": "Dangerous Wither skull block resistance",
  "category": "entities",
  "description": "Drive normal and dangerous Wither skulls into resistant blocks. Dangerous skulls destroy obsidian while ordinary skulls, Wither-immune blocks and disabled mob griefing preserve their blocks.",
